graph TD
    A[Acetyl-CoA Availability] --> B[Citrate Formation]
    B --> C[Citrate Transport]
    C --> D[ATP-Citrate Lyase]
    D --> E[Acetyl-CoA Production]
    E --> F[Acetyl-CoA Carboxylase]
    F --> G[Malonyl-CoA Formation]
    G --> H[Fatty Acid Synthase]
    H --> I[Fatty Acid Chain Extension]
    I --> J[Palmitate Production]
    J --> K[Fatty Acid Synthesis Complete]
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    A --> L[Direct Acetyl-CoA]
    L --> M[Acetyl-CoA Carboxylase]
    M --> G
    
    %% Regulation
    K --> N[Fatty Acid Levels]
    N --> O{Energy Status?}
    O -->|High Energy| P[Synthesis Inhibition]
    O -->|Low Energy| Q[Synthesis Activation]
    
    %% Key proteins
    R[ATP-Citrate Lyase] --> D
    S[Acetyl-CoA Carboxylase] --> F
    T[Fatty Acid Synthase] --> H
    U[Citrate] --> B
    V[Malonyl-CoA] --> G
    W[Palmitate] --> J
    X[Acetyl-CoA] --> E
    
